# supercronic crontab for the Dave container (https://github.com/aptible/supercronic), started by entrypoint.sh.
# Fields: minute hour day month weekday command, in the container's TZ (UTC). supercronic logs each job's output
# to the container log.

# Weekly wiki refresh, Monday 05:17. It only downloads when archive.org has a newer Miraheze dump, then imports
# it onto the living wiki's `official` branch and merges it into `living` (conflicted pages: Sonnet via claude -p).
17 5 * * 1 python3 -I /dave/app/tools/gtnh-search/update_wiki.py

# Memory history: commit the memory folder to the history volume every 10 minutes (nothing when unchanged).
*/10 * * * * python3 -I /dave/app/dave/memory/history.py snapshot

# Nightly memory tarball into the data volume, keeping 14: a quick restore point next to the history. Exports hold
# player data: they stay on the server or in a private backup, never in the (public) Dave-Agent repo.
43 4 * * * python3 -I /dave/app/dave/memory/store.py export /dave/data/exports 14
